{
  "name": "Free Builder",
  "short_name": "FreeBuilder",
  "description": "NBA 2K27 builds from the game's own tables: exact attribute ceilings, cap breaker ladders, badge requirements and archetype names. Not affiliated with NBA 2K, Visual Concepts, 2K Sports or Take-Two Interactive.",
